WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.600
From WhatsApp, the owner sends
today's pasta special.

2
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.740
Rosalia drafts the caption
in the restaurant's voice.

3
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.720
He asks her to make it shorter.
She does. He approves.

4
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.950
The post goes live on Instagram.
Comments come in.

5
00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.300
Rosalia replies on her own,

6
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.200
in the restaurant's voice,
so people stay engaged.

7
00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.030
The owner sees what she sent.

8
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.290
Routine comments do not wait
for approval.
